OL,3,GNEWSANew Peak District red routes raise
OL,4,A#4,600 in fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FRed routes introduced at a popular Peak
OL,7,FDistrict destination to combat
OL,8,Finconsiderate parking have brought in
OL,9,Fmore than #4,500 from penalty charge
OL,10,Fnotices.
OL,12,FDerbyshire County Council introduced
OL,13,Fred routes and new double yellow lines
OL,14,Fcovering the Castleton and Mam Tor area
OL,15,Fin May in response to parking issues
OL,16,Fcaused by high numbers of visitors.
OL,18,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,19,Fsaid since the red routes were
OL,20,Fintroduced 161 penalty charge notices
OL,21,Fhad been issued, resulting in fines
OL,22,Ftotalling #4,600.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
