OL,3,GNEWSANew Peak District red routes raise
OL,4,A#4,600 in fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharlotte Hill, the county council's
OL,7,Fcabinet member for highways, said the
OL,8,Fauthority believed the enforcement was
OL,9,Fhelping to address some of the
OL,10,F"congestion challenges experienced" in
OL,11,FCastleton.
